Desc:"ResearchGate has no geographic citation map and no embed support. Citation Map gives you a free one-line iframe for any personal academic website.",bestToolsTitle:"7 Best Citation Map Tools (Free & Paid Compared)",bestToolsDesc:"Hands-on comparison of the leading citation map and visualization tools â Citation Map, Connected Papers, VOSviewer, ResearchRabbit, and more.",eb1VisaTitle:"Citation Map for EB-1A & O-1A Visa Petitions",eb1VisaDesc:"How petitioners and immigration attorneys use geographic citation maps to evidence international acclaim and original contributions of major significance.",vsPythonTitle:"Citation Map vs Python GitHub Script: No-Code Path",vsPythonDesc:"Why a hosted citation map beats running the open-source Python citation-map script: no install, no API keys, no debugging â just paste a profile URL.",embedTitle:"How to Embed a Citation Map on Your Website",embedDesc:"Step-by-step iframe embed for personal academic sites, lab pages, and CVs â with size and theme options. No code, no plugins, no signup required.",gsPythonTitle:"Free Google Scholar Citation Map (No Python Needed)",gsPythonDesc:"The hosted alternative to the python citation-map script â no installation, no API keys, instant geographic visualization from a Google Scholar profile.",howToWriteLitReviewTitle:"How to Write a Literature Review in 8 Steps",howToWriteLitReviewDesc:"The full 8-step process â from scoping and citation chasing to the synthesis matrix and gap statement â with time budgets and per-step pitfalls.",litReviewOutlineTitle:"Literature Review Outline: 5 Templates by Format",litReviewOutlineDesc:"5 copy-paste outline templates with per-section word counts â review article, thesis chapter, PRISMA, Related Work, and grant background.",litVsSystematicTitle:"Literature Review vs Systematic Review",litVsSystematicDesc:"Narrative vs systematic: 9 side-by-side differences, a decision flowchart, PRISMA 2020 essentials, and where scoping reviews fit.",resea